        "mainText": "> CENL: People Jean-Marc Fellous (2025- Present: UCSD: Institute for Neural Computation and Halicioglu School of Data Science and Computing. 2006-2025: Univ. Arizona: Psychology, Neuroscience, Biomedical Engineering and Applied Mathematics) Postdocs Looking for more ... Graduate Students (Our Motto ) Olimpia Carrioli (UCSD, BioEngineering, PhD, Spring 2026, rotation) Marium Yousuf ( Univ. Arizona, Applied Mathematics, PhD, Fall 2022 - Summer 2026) Looking for more! Undergraduate Students ( Lab song -- Lab's favorite scientific fact ) RECRUITING!!! Rylan Breneman (Fall 2026 -) looking for more.... Main Current Collaborations Dr. Jim Knierim (Johns Hopkins University) Dr. Sachin Deshmukh (Shiv Nadar University) Dr. Collins Assisi (IISER Pune) Dr. Alfredo Weitzenfeld (University of South Florida, FL) Recent picture(s) of the lab (right click/View Image to see high res image...) 7/15/2024: By Bye Heather! Good luck in Grad school at UCLA! More lab pictures... Alumni"
